{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/9260164f3a93a9068cee1e2317bd0cb1.avif?t=1759824510\" width=616 height=107 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Halloween was supposed to be simple.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halloween is off to a rough start. The plan was simple: get ready, grab your friend, and hit the party. But when the mayor turns up dead in a back alley, &quot;simple&quot; is officially off the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Sunny Summers. She's got a moody attitude, a wardrobe that's 99% black, and zero interest in being a hero \u2014 or anything positive really. She takes out her mood swings on her AI companion Cogs, a lovable penguin robot. They are, without a doubt, the worst duo to ever be tasked with solving a murder. But sometimes, you don't get to choose your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A modern take on the classic Point-and-Click genre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Investigate a conspiracy bigger than one dead body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve challenging logic puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Endure nonsensical humor and snappy dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stuff, craft stuff, shoot stuff (in that order)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the evil (and mostly your own inner demons)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PSA: Sunny and Cogs are unstoppable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/813eda4b33e5b0dda83a3d7d06798976.poster.avif?t=1759824510\" width=154 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/813eda4b33e5b0dda83a3d7d06798976.webm?t=1759824510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/813eda4b33e5b0dda83a3d7d06798976.mp4?t=1759824510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878860?t=1759824510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/e69d6c66f254022fa47c3715a5910031f2d115bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759824510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/fae7992ca5c876268633fc7b534991b1522a9898/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759824510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/fae7992ca5c876268633fc7b534991b1522a9898/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759824510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game is a satirical murder mystery that uses dark humor, similar in tone to adult animated tv shows.\r\n\r\nContent includes:\r\n\r\n- Violence: The story centers around a murder investigation. It features a non-gory depiction of a dead body and scenes of cartoonish, fantasy violence.\r\n\r\n- Drug & Alcohol Use: Frequent references to alcohol, tobacco, and illegal drugs (such as cocaine and marijuana) are present, mostly in a satirical context.\r\n\r\n- Strong Language: Contains moderate to strong profanity, swearing, and crude language throughout the dialogue.\r\n\r\n- Sexual Themes: Contains sexual innuendo, crude humor\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis game is intended for a mature audience. Player discretion is advised."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4013120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/9260164f3a93a9068cee1e2317bd0cb1.avif?t=1759824510\" width=616 height=107 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Halloween was supposed to be simple.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halloween is off to a rough start. The plan was simple: get ready, grab your friend, and hit the party. But when the mayor turns up dead in a back alley, &quot;simple&quot; is officially off the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Sunny Summers. She's got a moody attitude, a wardrobe that's 99% black, and zero interest in being a hero \u2014 or anything positive really. She takes out her mood swings on her AI companion Cogs, a lovable penguin robot. They are, without a doubt, the worst duo to ever be tasked with solving a murder. But sometimes, you don't get to choose your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A modern take on the classic Point-and-Click genre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Investigate a conspiracy bigger than one dead body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve challenging logic puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Endure nonsensical humor and snappy dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stuff, craft stuff, shoot stuff (in that order)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the evil (and mostly your own inner demons)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PSA: Sunny and Cogs are unstoppable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/813eda4b33e5b0dda83a3d7d06798976.poster.avif?t=1759824510\" width=154 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/813eda4b33e5b0dda83a3d7d06798976.webm?t=1759824510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/extras/813eda4b33e5b0dda83a3d7d06798976.mp4?t=1759824510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Reliq"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878860/754a96a5467505cd7dc56e0076373a395be88dbb/header.jpg?t=1759824510","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Aegis Protocol \u00a9 2025 Reliq, Switzerland. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit 2+ Cores (1.2GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>O